        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h2>LilypadVR (currently inactive)</h2>
          <p>
            This is where I used to sell full-body tracking equipment for VR, up until tariffs
            hit
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
    
    <a
    href="https://jinxxy.com/RelliRito"
    target="_blank"
    style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;"
    >
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">
